# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add`.
#
# The skill files themselves are vendored third-party content (~290KB
# of Markdown for cloudflare/security-audit-skill alone) and are
# reproducible from skills-lock.json, which IS tracked. .claude/skills
# also holds OS symlinks, which do not travel well between machines.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
